---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Discover Bhubaneswar">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 class="hero-weight text-4xl mb-8">About Discover Bhubaneswar</h1>

    <p>
      Discover Bhubaneswar is a publication dedicated to the city of
      Bhubaneswar and the wider state of Odisha. It brings together stories
      about the places, people, culture and events that shape this part of India.
    </p>

    <p>
      From local food and heritage to inspiring personalities, urban
      development, travel and everyday city life, we explore the many
      stories that make Bhubaneswar and Odisha worth discovering.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our archive brings together articles, interviews, photographs and
      perspectives documenting the city and its changing landscape.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
